Description: Boswas OS release identity and core configuration
 Boswas OS is the Boswas Group company-managed desktop operating system,
 built on Debian 13 "trixie". This package carries the Boswas OS release
 identity (/usr/lib/boswas/release), the device configuration skeleton under
 /etc/boswas, the console login banner, and pulls in the other Boswas OS
 components.
 .
 Debian's own identity (/etc/os-release) is intentionally left unchanged so
 Debian tooling and third-party software keep recognising the system.
